From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: USA-RedDragon <USA-RedDragon@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 08:58:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(vision): fit resize mode, image size keys

Native images (vision_analyze, browser screenshots, MCP images) were halved to JPEG when over 1568 px or 256 KB, so a 1920x1080 screenshot reached the model at 960x540 and 10 px text was unreadable. vision.resize_mode: fit scales once to vision.embed_max_dimension, keeps PNG while it fits vision.embed_target_bytes, then tries JPEG quality steps at that size and only then halves. vision.embed_max_dimension (default 1568, 256..8000) replaces the fixed cap in every image path, including the device plugin's browser images. Defaults (halve, 1568, 256 KB) keep upstream's behavior.
---
